<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/msa@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Kanun Keseksaan [Akta 574], yang disebut “Kanun” dalam Akta ini, dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 52 seksyen yang berikut: ‘ “Non-serious offence” 52a. The words “non-serious offence” denote an offence punishable with imprisonment for a term of not more than ten years. “Serious offence” 52b. The words “serious offence” denote an offence punishable with imprisonment for a term of ten years or more.’. Seksyen baru 75a"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/msa@> .
