<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/msa@/~cl_31> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "31" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/msa@> .
