<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/msa@/~cl_8__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan “which may extend to five years” dengan perkataan “of not less than five years and not more than twenty years”; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/9/msa@> .
